      R. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطْمَطَ فِى كَلَامِهِ</span></b>  <i>He extended, and
lengthened, his speech:</i> (IDrd:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطْمَطَ</span> signifies
<i>he flagged</i> in his handwriting, or in his speech.
(IAar, Az, K.)

